{c: Verse 1}
[C]Dil se tujh ko [G]bedili hai,        [G]mujh ko hai dil ka [C]gurur
[G]Tu ye maane ke na [C]maane,        [Am]log [F]maanenge [C]jarur
[Am]Ye mera di [Dm]waanaapan hai,        [Am]ya mohabbat [Dm]ka surur
[C]Tu na pahachaa [F]ne to hai ye,        [G]teri najron [F]ka kasur.. [Am]
[C]Dil ko teri [G]hi tamanna,        [G]dil ko hai tujh [C]se hi pyaar
[G]Chaahe tu [C]aye na aye,        [G]ham karenge [F]intajaar.. [Am]
[Am]Ye mera di [Dm]waanaapan hai,        [Am]ya mohabbat [Dm]ka surur
[C]Tu na pahachaa [F]ne to hai ye,        [G]teri najron [F]ka kasur.. [Am]
[C]Aise wiraa [G]ne men ek din,        [G]ghut ke mar jaa [C]yenge ham
[G]Jitana ji [C]chaahe pukaaro,        [G]fir nahin [F]ayenge ham.. [Am]
[Am]Ye mera di [Dm]waanaapan hai,        [Am]ya mohabbat [Dm]ka surur
